  "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/lasantosr/intelli-shell/tarball/v3.4.7",
  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/lasantosr/intelli-shell/zipball/v3.4.7",
  "body": "This release strengthens runtime stability across the CLI, restores exact alias search behavior when filters are active, and improves configuration documentation reliability.\r\n\r\n### Improvements\r\n\r\n- **Zero-Panic Runtime Reliability**: Hardened error handling across all core application routines, replacing unhandled panics with structured error propagation for a much more resilient CLI experience.\r\n- **Optimized Regex Evaluation**: Transitioned pattern matching to compile-time validated regular expressions.\r\n\r\n### Bug Fixes\r\n\r\n- **Filtered Alias Resolution**: Fixed a regression introduced in v3.4.6 where applying category or default filters (such as `user_only`) inadvertently disabled exact alias matches. Exact alias searches now correctly match within active category and source filters.\r\n\r\n### Documentation\r\n\r\n- **Anchor-Based Documentation Consistency**: Transitioned configuration documentation to named section anchors, ensuring sample snippets stay synchronized with default configuration files across releases without broken references."
}
